#. [campaign]: id=The_South_Guard
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/_main.cfg:9
msgid "The South Guard"
msgstr "משמר הדרום (The South Guard)"

#. [campaign]: id=The_South_Guard
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/_main.cfg:10
msgid "TSG"
msgstr "TSG"

#. [campaign]: id=The_South_Guard
#: data/campaigns/The_South_Guard/_main.cfg:20
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A young knight, Deoran, is dispatched to the southern frontier town of "
#| "Westin. Thrust quickly into a hapless conflict against marauding bandits, "
#| "Deoran soon encounters darker forces at play. Rally the South Guard and "
#| "defend your homes!\n"
#| "\n"
#| "<i><b>This is the recommended starting campaign.</b></i>\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"A young knight, Deoran, is dispatched to the southern Wesnoth province of "
"Kerlath to investigate the ravaged towns at the border. Thrust quickly into "
"a hapless conflict against marauding bandits, Deoran must rally the "
"remaining men of the derelict South Guard to defend his country.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"אביר צעיר, דיאורן, נשלח אל ווסטין, עיירת הספר הדרומית. מושלך במהירות אל תוך "
"סכסוך אומלל מול שודדים פושטים, מגלה דיאורן עד מהרה כי כוחות אפלים יותר "
"פועלים במחשכים. אסוף את משמר הדרום והגן על בתיכם!\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>זוהי הקמפיין המומלצת לפתיחה.</b></i>\n"
"\n"

