#~ msgid "Building a Powerful Army"
#~ msgstr "בניית צבא רב-עוצמה"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Units gain experience with each attack, and much more with each kill.\n"
#~ "<i><b>Most campaigns expect</b></i> you to recall the same veterans "
#~ "across each battle,\n"
#~ "building experience and eventually accumulating <i><b>a roster of "
#~ "powerful level-2\n"
#~ "or level-3 units.</b></i>\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "If you don’t have many level-2 or level-3 units right now, don’t "
#~ "despair!\n"
#~ "This campaign is not excessively difficult and can still be completed\n"
#~ "with a weak army, though it may require skilled tactics. But in future\n"
#~ "campaigns, <i><b>be sure to protect your veterans and build them into a "
#~ "powerful\n"
#~ "army.</b></i>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "יחידות צוברות ניסיון בכל התקפה, והרבה יותר בכל הרג.\n"
#~ "<i><b>רוב הקמפיינים מצפות</b></i> שתשיב לשירות את אותם ותיקים בכל קרב,\n"
